        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "An emphatic colloquial passive",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "The extra marker before the action reinforces a colloquial passive. It does not mean giving an object to a recipient. Keep the affected object and the acting person distinct.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我的书被他给拿走了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ de shū bèi tā gěi ná zǒu le 。",
                "meaning": "My book was taken away by him.",
                "audio": "79a6c742d7b1053ada3ec272b2237377795cb51b7098f617dda24932cc6a83bf"
              }
            ]
          },
